flowchart TD
 A[Startup assumption] --> B[Evidence and counterevidence]
 B --> C{Enough evidence for next commitment?}
 C -- No --> D[Bounded falsification test]
 D --> B
 C -- Yes --> E[Contribution and dependency stress]
 E --> F{Within agreed limits?}
 F -- Yes --> G[Continue next bounded step]
 F -- No --> H[Change one assumption or stop experiment]
